1 NAME Balthazar Conrad /Lange/
2 GIVN Balthazar Conrad
2 _MARNM Lange
2 NICK Baltazar Lange
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 25 MAR 1854
2 PLAC Stokker gård
2 ADDR
3 CITY Asker
3 STAE Akershus
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 19 SEP 1937
