1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * 1910 - Chicago, Cook County, Illinois
2 CONT * 1920 - Chicago, Cook County, Illinois
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Christian Hanson Sr., 84, 2524 Lady Lake Blvd, Lady Lake, Florida, died Saturday Oct 2, 1993.            
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Chicago, Illinois.  He was an Army veteran of World War II.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas moved to Central Florida in 1946.  He was a member of Weirsdale Presbyterian Church. Mr Hanson was a citrus grower.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors: wife, Agnes E; son, Thomas C. Jr., Lady Lake; daughter, Virginia H. Germond, Lakeland; brothers, Dr. John O., Stuart, Florida; Dr Harold C., Urbana, Illinois; sisters, Katherine Koons, Stuart, Florida; Marion Benton, Ta
2 CONC coma, Washington; and four grandchildren. 
