2 CONT ----
2 CONT Peder NILSEN Sunde (1721) was skipper, reder, handelsmann. He was born circa 1590 at Sunde Br.15 II, Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Birgitte RASMUSDTR Nordberg (1728), daughter of Rasmus (--?--) Abelnes, Nordberg (2226) and R
2 CONC annj (--?--) Abelnes, Nordberg (2227). He appeared on the census of 1645 at Abelnes, Hidra. He Han hadde 5 barn. I 1647 eide Peder: I Hidra: ytre Ulland 2 huder, lille Håland 1 Hud.pantegods i Bakke: Øksendal 2 hud 5 eng. pantegod
2 CONC s Ovedal 8 eng. pantegods Jendal 8 eng. pantegods Sirdal: vestre Tonstad 1 hud 6 eng. pantegods. Gyland: nordre Hamar 1 hud pantegods Heskestad: Eide 8 eng. pantegods Lista: midtre Kalleberg 2 huder 6 eng. Håle 1 hud Spind; Bostev
2 CONC oll: 1 hud 6 eng. Herad: Bulega 1 hud ant. pantegods Grimestad 1 hud ant. pantegods Saudland 1 hud ant. pantegods Lyngdal: Skoland 1 hud 6 eng. store Røyskår 3 eng. lille Røyskår 1 1/2 eng. 15 huder 57 1/2 eng. = 19 huder 9 1/2 en
2 CONC g.eller ca.19 3/4 hud a.12 eng pr.hud --------------------- in 1647. He appeared on the census of 1647 at Abelnes, Hidra. He appeared on the census of 1650/51 at Abelnes, (source: Signe Elisabeth Zijdemans)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT [Ref. Nes 2.II, s.216]
2 CONT
2 CONT 	 I 1647 eide Peder: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	 I Hidra:          ytre Ulland  2 huder, lille Håland 1 Hud.pantegods 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	 i Bakke:     Øksendal 2 hud 5 eng. pantegods         Ovedal 8 eng. pantegods         Jendal 8 eng. pantegods
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Sirdal:          vestre Tonstad  1 hud  6 eng. pantegods. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Gyland:     nordre Hamar    1 hud  pantegods
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Heskestad:      Eide  8 eng. pantegods
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Lista:          midtre Kalleberg 2 huder 6 eng.       Håle 1 hud 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Spind;          Bostevoll:       1 hud  6 eng.     
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Herad:          Bulega           1 hud      ant. pantegods      Grimestad        1 hud ant. pantegods      Saudland 1 hud ant. pantegods 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	  Lyngdal:     Skoland        1 hud  6 eng.         store Røyskår 3 eng.         lille Røyskår 1 1/2 eng.                      
2 CONT
