1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Valorie Devon Kammert, 60, Rapid City, South Dakota, died Sunday, February 5, 2017 at the Rapid City Regional Hospice Auxiliary House of complications from multiple myeloma. She is survived by her husband Jim, daug
2 CONC hter Katie, and son Alan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Val loved her profession as a nurse anesthetist, and she brought the same level of dedication, enthusiasm, and skill to her many interested, including gardening, quilting, knitting, stained glass artwork, and even drinking tea. Sh
2 CONC e was equally ready to lend a hand with a project or to marvel at the creativity of others.
2 CONT
2 CONT Val had many friends because she was good at being a friend. Most of all, she loved her family and enriched their lives with her zeal to enjoy the world around her and make the most of each day.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * 1985 - Married - Mark Zandee, Grand Rapids, Michigan. 
2 CONT * Oct 1990 - Married - James Alan Kammert - Escanaba, Michigan. (living)
2 CONT ----
