2 CONT
2 CONT Survived the War? Yes
2 CONT
2 CONT Service RecordEnlisted in Company H, Wisconsin 2nd Infantry Regiment on 21 May 1861.Mustered out on 15 Jan 1864.Transferred to on 15 Jan 1864.
2 CONT
