3 CTRY Norway
1 BIRT
2 DATE 31 MAR 1911
2 ADDR
3 CITY Trondheim
3 STAE Sør-Trøndelag
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 SEP 1987
2 PLAC Hamang i Sandvika
